abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. For the unmodified Chambolle–Pock method with small extrapolation, explicit compact polytopes give nonconvergent periodic orbits for every step product above two, an exact universal three-cycle threshold is proved, and a robust rational seven-cycle is certified. Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
